# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored via *.local) and fill in. Never commit real keys.

# MapTiler API key for the satellite maps: the Spacer project viewer (/p/:shortCode) and the IRA Towers
# location map (/ira-towers/explore/map). Get one at https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/.
# Vite exposes VITE_* variables to the browser, so this key is public by design: restrict it to your
# site's domains (and localhost for development) in the MapTiler dashboard.
# Without it, both maps show a fallback screen; the rest of the app is unaffected.
VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=

# Google Maps Platform key with the Map Tiles API enabled (and billing on the Google Cloud project).
# With it, the Spacer project viewer shows Google's satellite photo with Google's roads and names;
# without it, the viewer uses Esri's imagery. Restrict it to your domains and to the Map Tiles API.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_KEY=
